{
 "encounter_id": "00785",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "FAMILY_MEMBER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, thank you for fitting us in. It's Mum, she's getting out of breath just walking to the bathroom."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Hello, Mrs Brennan. Is that right, short of breath on the way to the bathroom?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Well, it's not that bad. I get a bit puffed."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Mum, you have to sit down on the landing. Every time."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "When did it start?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh, a while ago. A month? Two? I don't keep track."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'd say it's been six weeks, since the cold, but I'm not certain either, Mum was already slow before it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll note that neither of you is sure. Any chest pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No pain. No."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any swelling of your legs, or a cough?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My ankles puff up by evening. No cough."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What tablets are you on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Bisoprolol, 5 mg once a day, and furosemide, 40 mg in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And what are those for?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Her heart, she has heart failure, and high blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Who is at home with you, Mrs Brennan?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I live alone. Sheila here pops in every day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me listen to your chest. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go on.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The heart sounds are regular, and there are fine crackles at the bottom of both lungs. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is it her heart, doctor? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "With the heart failure history, and the ankle swelling, I'd say this is likely her heart failure getting worse, with fluid building up."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh, I see. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's treatable. I'd like to arrange blood tests and a heart scan, an echocardiogram, to see how the heart is pumping."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Will she need to go into hospital? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not today, if you can both watch her closely. The blood tests today, and the scan in the next two weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please weigh her each morning, and ring me if her weight rises by two kilos in three days, or she's breathless at rest."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I will. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you both in a week, to check how she is and look at the blood results."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "A week. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
